<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Privacy Policy — WhatsApp Messaging' }) %>
</head>
<body class="bg-light">
  <%- include('partials/legal-top', { page: 'privacy', heading: 'Privacy Policy', updated: '13 November 2026' }) %>

      <p>
        This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>DNE Technology Consultants INC.</strong>
        ("we", "us", or "our") handles information processed through the
        WhatsApp Messaging application (the "Service").
      </p>

      <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Information we process</h2>
      <p>Depending on how you use the Service, we may process:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>WhatsApp phone numbers and recipient information you submit;</li>
        <li>message content, templates, and variables used for sending;</li>
        <li>delivery, failure, and webhook status information supplied by Meta; and</li>
        <li>account, authentication, and technical information needed to operate and secure the Service.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="h4 mt-4">How we use information</h2>
      <p>
        We use this information to provide and secure the Service, validate phone
        numbers, send requested WhatsApp messages, monitor delivery status,
        troubleshoot failures, prevent abuse, and meet applicable legal
        obligations. We do not use submitted information for unrelated purposes.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h4 mt-4">WhatsApp and service providers</h2>
      <p>
        The Service uses Meta's WhatsApp Business and Graph API services to send
        messages and receive delivery events. Information sent through those
        services is also subject to Meta's applicable terms and privacy policies.
        We may use hosting, database, logging, and security providers to operate
        the Service, and require them to protect information they process for us.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Retention and security</h2>
      <p>
        We retain information only for as long as reasonably necessary for the
        purposes described above, including operational records, security, and
        legal requirements. We use reasonable technical and organizational
        safeguards, but no internet transmission or storage system can be
        guaranteed to be completely secure.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Your requests</h2>
      <p>
        To ask about, access, correct, or delete information processed through
        the Service, contact us using the details below. To stop receiving
        messages, reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any message from us. For how to
        have your data deleted, see our <a href="/data-deletion">Data Deletion</a>
        page. We may need to verify your request before completing it and may
        retain information where the law requires or permits us to do so.
      </p>

  <%- include('partials/legal-bottom') %>
</body>
</html>
